-- Compiler: MeadowBoot's passes as queries (`database!`), inside units built
-- by Lingua's build (`make!`).
--
-- A unit -- a package (`Unit`) -- is compiled against the interfaces of the
-- units it depends on: what each tells the units after it. Inside one, each
-- step is a query, worked out when asked and remembered, and asked again only
-- when something it read has changed: a file's text is an input, its tree
-- (`parsed`) a query of it, the unit's fixities (`fixities`) a query of every
-- tree and the imported interfaces, a file grouped by them (`grouped`) a
-- query of both, and the unit's names resolved (`renamed`) a query of every
-- grouped file and what the units before it export.

